    {
      "id": "vm4v847",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5. NITI Aayog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "77fu5i3",
      "content": "In 2015, the Planning Commission was replaced by NITI Aayog (National Institution for Transforming India). It acts as a policy think tank for the Government of India."
    },
    {
      "id": "10gw2oc",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "Functions of NITI Aayog"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8ppq68q",
      "content": "• Promote cooperative federalism."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lt7i35v",
      "content": "• Provide policy advice to the government."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "c0w3ykz",
      "content": "• Promote sustainable development."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "NITI Aayog was established on January 1, 2015, replacing the 65-year-old Planning Commission.",
        "The Prime Minister serves as the ex-officio Chairperson of both NITI Aayog and formerly the Planning Commission.",
        "Distinction between Top-Down planning (Planning Commission) and Bottom-Up planning (NITI Aayog) is frequently tested."
      ],
      "id": "voqn68t"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "g3b9y2b",
      "content": "• Encourage innovation and entrepreneurship."
    },
    {
      "id": "w0uqig7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "nu65nnf",
      "content": "• Planning Commission was established in 1950."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "3vqq4nf",
      "content": "• The First Five-Year Plan started in 1951."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "u78ibmo",
      "content": "• NITI Aayog replaced Planning Commission in 2015."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "ctyps7m",
      "content": "• Prime Minister is the Chairperson of NITI Aayog."
    }
  ],
